<3 Test functions with return statements and expressions

<3 Function that adds two values and returns the result
=^._.^= add(x) ><(((,^>
  result :=) x :+) 10
  return result
<^,)))><

<3 Function that multiplies by 2
=^._.^= multiply(x) ><(((,^>
  return x :*) 2
<^,)))><

<3 Function with no parameters
=^._.^= getConstant() ><(((,^>
  return 42
<^,)))><

<3 Test the functions
a :=) 5
b :=) add(a)
c :=) multiply(b)
d :=) getConstant()

:P(a)
:P(b)
:P(c)
:P(d)

<3 Use function call in expression
result :=) add(10) :+) multiply(5)
:P(result)